Vendor the canonical text before the first public release
---------------------------------------------------------

The full text of the licence is deliberately not reproduced here: a
hand-transcribed copy of a legal document is a liability, not a licence.  Run

    curl -fsSL https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt -o LICENSE

from the repository root and commit the result.  Until that is done, this
repository is not ready to be published.  See LICENSING.md for the reasoning
behind the choice and for the commercial-licensing path.
